{
 "duration": 27.384,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Marco planned a December sunset at Glacier Point in Yosemite.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 4.237
  },
  {
   "text": "A few miles up, the road was gated.",
   "start": 4.437,
   "end": 6.477
  },
  {
   "text": "In winter, Glacier Point Road is usually closed beyond the Badger Pass ski area until late spring.",
   "start": 6.677,
   "end": 12.951
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 13.151,
   "end": 14.078
  },
  {
   "text": "For a winter view, stop at Tunnel View on the Wawona Road instead.",
   "start": 14.278,
   "end": 17.995
  },
  {
   "text": "Carry tire chains and check road status on nps.gov that morning.",
   "start": 18.195,
   "end": 22.857
  },
  {
   "text": "He watched El Capitan turn gold.",
   "start": 23.057,
   "end": 24.844
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your Yosemite trip.",
   "start": 25.244,
   "end": 27.184
  }
 ],
